   22563/   1B2EC :                     ; ZONE ANIMATION PROCEDURES AND SCRIPTS
   22564/   1B2EC :                     ;
   22565/   1B2EC :                     ; Each zone gets two entries in this jump table. The first entry points to the
   22566/   1B2EC :                     ; zone's animation procedure (usually Dynamic_Null, AKA none). The second points
   22567/   1B2EC :                     ; to the zone's animation script.
   22568/   1B2EC :                     ;
   22569/   1B2EC :                     ; Seems like stage IDs were already being shifted, since listings for $07-$0F
   22570/   1B2EC :                     ; can be found, alongside HPZ's art listed from $08 (its ID in the final).
   22571/   1B2EC :                     ; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
   22572/   1B2EC :                     DynArtCue_Index:
